'''Crazed Fish Cat''' (狂乱のネコフィッシュ, ''Kyōran no Neko Fisshu'', '''Frenzy Fish Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that first appears in [[Fish Hell (Insane)|Fish Hell]], where it can be unlocked as a [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cat Unit]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]].

