==Enemy==
This enemy is less threatening than the other Crazed Cats, due to sporting a rather underwhelming 87,000 HP and only 6 movement speed, along with relatively low range. However, it is not to be trifled with, as it tends to be spammed in most of the stages it appears in and has 7,000 DPS. Additionally, it comes packing the capability to perform a [[Critical Hit]] on your units, albeit at a low chance.

==Strategy==
Try stacking ranged cats such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] with a proper meatshield flow to keep a swarm of them at bay. In [[Fish Hell (Insane)|Fish Hell]], don't forget to bring [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Cat]], [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]] or other [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]] for the [[Super Metal Hippoe]].

